  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fortalecimiento del Gestin del Gasto Pblico II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening of Public Expenditure Management II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del programa es apoyar los esfuerzos del gobierno de Surinam en mejorar la gestin del gasto pblico. Las reformas se combinan iniciativas de polticas y acciones del gobierno en tres reas: (i) la gestin de la inversin pblica, (ii) la compra pblica, y (iii) la gestin financiera y auditora.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the program is to support the Government of Suriname&apos;s reform effort to enhance public capital expenditure management. The reforms combine policy initiatives and government actions in three areas: (i) public investment management; (ii) public procurement, and (iii) public financial management and audit.</narrative>
  </description>
